 'gidai/kaledines-dovanos-tevams':'One shared gift versus two choices, including both parents equally and resolving collective-giver logistics.',
 'gidai/kaledines-dovanos-porai':'A complete two-person Christmas gift by involvement, location and time; actual kit drying stages versus ready result.',
 'gidai/kaledines-dovanos-seimai':'Whole-family participation, accessible voluntary roles, total group cost and a ready first activity.',
